    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voltaria is a fully automated nuclear facility. At least, that\u2019s what the logs say. You\u2019re sent in to diagnose critical malfunctions, but as you explore the silent halls, it becomes clear: the systems aren\u2019t behaving as they should.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience slow-building dread in a world of cold precision. Voltaria delivers environmental storytelling, AI-driven mystery, and psychological horror without relying on cheap scares. There is no combat. Just you, the machines \u2013 and whatever else might be watching.</p>",
